  "what_this_is": "Published ONERA M6 data: experimental surface pressures at the seven span stations (NASA WIND validation archive, upper and lower surface per station), the TMR case files, the section profiles, and the sharp-trailing-edge CAD. Archived into the repository because artifacts/ is gitignored and wiped, and because experimental data gets harder to obtain with time, not easier.",
